/**
 * @mainpage ManuMesh Internal Source Reference
 *
 * @section internal_scope Scope
 *
 * This site is the private engineering reference for ManuMesh implementation
 * code. It includes the public declarations under `include/` for context and
 * all implementation files under `src/`, including private, static, local,
 * anonymous-namespace, and otherwise undocumented symbols.
 *
 * @section internal_navigation Navigation
 *
 * - Use **Files** to browse the implementation by source directory.
 * - Use **Namespaces**, **Classes**, and **Class Members** for symbol lookup.
 * - Open a file's **Source** view for inline code with cross-references.
 * - Function pages include caller and callee graphs when Graphviz is present.
 *
 * @section internal_build Build
 *
 * @code{.powershell}
 * cmake --build build/mingw-ninja-release --target docs-internal --parallel
 * @endcode
 *
 * The generated entry point is `docs/internal/html/index.html`.
 *
 * @section internal_policy Documentation policy
 *
 * Internal documentation is generated with `EXTRACT_ALL=YES`, so missing
 * Doxygen comments do not hide implementation symbols or fail the build.
 * Add `///` or `/** ... */` comments when a symbol owns a non-obvious
 * invariant, numerical assumption, lifecycle rule, concurrency constraint,
 * or failure mode. Routine implementation details should remain readable in
 * code rather than receiving repetitive comments.
 *
 * @warning This is an internal implementation view. It is not an installed
 * SDK contract and can change without API or ABI compatibility guarantees.
 */
